tered on Form S-8 on October 2, 2024. None of the consultants had a shareholding of 5% or above.","context":"Issuance under Stock Incentive Plan","section":"Item 4. Information on the Company","block":453,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-038674","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-08-17","reportDate":"2026-03-31","cik":"0001966678","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1966678/000149315226038674/form20-f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/48ef7e74a66e3abaf3748ca9820fc3a51b90cea4191289c31f2b1557e1db1c81.bin","sha256":"48ef7e74a66e3abaf3748ca9820fc3a51b90cea4191289c31f2b1557e1db1c81"}},{"id":"5d42b7dfa3c46e3e8c8b73193b6fcf43383efc43257e5a2abe35a1edf159a258","quote":"The total contract amount for all consultants was US$9,216,000. For the year ended March 31, 2025, the Company recognized US$6,144,000 as an expense. The remaining portion, US$3,072,000 has been recorded as prepayment and was recognized as an expense in the 2026 financial year.","context":"On October 7, 2024, the Company issued, in aggregate, 2,400,000 ordinary shares (150,000 ordinary shares after giving effect of reverse stock split on February 17, 2026), par value US$0.00005 (US$0.0008, after giving effect to the share consolidation) each to four consultants, each an independent third party, as provided under the 2024 Stock Incentive Plan. The 2024 Stock Incentive Plan was registered on Form S-8 on October 2, 2024. None of the consultants had a shareholding of 5% or above.","section":"Item 4. Information on the Company","block":454,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-038674","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-08-17","reportDate":"2026-03-31","cik":"0001966678","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1966678/000149315226038674/form20-f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/48ef7e74a66e3abaf3748ca9820fc3a51b