 on the financial asset.","context":"Measurement of credit losses on financial instruments","section":"Item 19. Exhibits.","block":1331,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-038674","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-08-17","reportDate":"2026-03-31","cik":"0001966678","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1966678/000149315226038674/form20-f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/48ef7e74a66e3abaf3748ca9820fc3a51b90cea4191289c31f2b1557e1db1c81.bin","sha256":"48ef7e74a66e3abaf3748ca9820fc3a51b90cea4191289c31f2b1557e1db1c81"}},{"id":"429e771d1b29869a6a8ea04b1b5b77512148c8ee049eb99210ed224ec77fb4f6","quote":"Certain of our contracts contain retention provisions whereby a portion of the revenue earned is withheld from payment as a form of security until contractual provisions are satisfied. Retention receivable was assessed for impairment in accordance with ASC 326.","context":"Retention receivable","section":"Item 19. Exhibits.","block":1384,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-038674","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-08-17","reportDate":"2026-03-31","cik":"0001966678","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1966678/000149315226038674/form20-f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/48ef7e74a66e3abaf3748ca9820fc3a51b90cea4191289c31f2b1557e1db1c81.bin","sha256":"48ef7e74a66e3abaf3748ca9820fc3a51b90cea4191289c31f2b1557e1db1c81"}},{"id":"0eaf19b0c08ac76659e90dd4a0091882e5e84a53640f5b301e0a3dc8e59eae51","quote":"| | As of March 31, | | | 2025 | | | 2026 | | | USD (Non-current) | | | USD (Current) | Beginning balance | | | 446,651 | | | | 493,147 | Additions from condition rights to consideration | | | 342,698 | | | | - | Less: retention released | | | (296,202 | ) | | | (108,500 | ) Less: allowance for expected credit loss | | | (29,077 | ) | | | (384,647 | ) Ending balance | | | 464,0